# 9f-pre P5b: save-borne options planted BY NAME (inc-cjos0). OPT_DIFFICULTY is a chargen-block option (100-199) with
# a value family (DIFF_*); OPT_AUTOHIDE is a tactical-block option (500-599), a bare number. A display-block option
# (OPT_SOFT_PALETTE) is refused: tools/pressure/specs/p5b-refused.spec holds that line.
option OPT_DIFFICULTY DIFF_NIGHTMARE
option OPT_AUTOHIDE 1
